    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38945" root="ملط" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِيطٌ</span></b>  The fœtus of a camel <i>having as yet no
hair grown upon it:</i> (S, K:) or <i>that is cast
prematurely;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِيصٌ</span>. (K, TA, in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ملص</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, <i>A lamb</i> or <i>kid:</i> or <i>one just
born.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also what next follows.

